<section class="row-am experts" id="experts">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="exp-main-wrp">
      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 expert-title-wrap">
        <div class="exprt-title">Ruby On Rails Development Experts</div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 expert-title-content">
        <div class="row next-title">
          <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
            <div class="expert-left">When we say we cover the full Ruby on Rails lifecycle, we mean it.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
            <div class="expert-right">
              <p>If you have a checklist of 10 things to build for your Rails MVP, take the first step and give us a call. We will handle the rest.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="three-experts row">
          <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 three-experts-single">
            <div class="exp-img">
              <%= image_tag "exp1.png", alt: "Rapid Development" %>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-name font-uppercase wow fadeInDown">Rapid Development</div>
            <p>Our Agile/Scrum approach and two-week sprint cadence help you ship incrementally and quickly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 three-experts-single">
            <div class="exp-img">
              <%= image_tag "exp2.png", alt: "Cost Savings" %>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-name font-uppercase wow fadeInDown">Cost Savings</div>
            <p>You do not need to carry hiring overhead or benefits costs. We keep the engagement lean while holding the quality bar high.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 three-experts-single">
            <div class="exp-img">
              <%= image_tag "exp3.png", alt: "Onward and Upward" %>
            </div>

            <div class="exp-name font-uppercase wow fadeInDown">Onward and Upward</div>
            <p>We know how critical it is to get customers using your product. We listen to feedback and incorporate requested changes in future sprints.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="red-btn-wrp c-center"><%= link_to "Know More", services_index_path, class: "red-btn hvr-radial-in", aria: { label: "Learn more about our development services" } %></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
